  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "gr-there-is",
  "connector": "there is / are",
  "gloss": "ada",
  "title": "there is, there are — ada",
  "pattern": "There is ＋ satu benda / There are ＋ benda jamak / Is there …?",
  "explanation": "“Ada …” dalam bahasa Inggris adalah There is (satu) atau There are (lebih dari satu). Dalam percakapan disingkat There’s: There’s a café near the station. (Ada kafe di dekat stasiun.) Pertanyaannya Is there…? / Are there…?, negatifnya There isn’t… / There aren’t…",
  "natural": "Sangat berguna untuk menanyakan tempat: Is there a supermarket near here? (Ada supermarket di dekat sini?)",
  "stiff": "“Ada” sering diterjemahkan jadi have: Near here have a café. salah. Yang benar There’s a café near here.",
